<ProjectLayout slug="arena-waves">
  <p>
    <em>Arena Waves</em> is a projection mapping installation created for
    Trinitatiskirche in Cologne.
  </p>

  <p>
    The work transforms the architecture of the church through moving images,
    exploring the relationship between light, spatial rhythm and the existing
    structure of the building.
  </p>

  <p>
    Hand-drawn animation expands across the architectural surface, turning the
    interior into a shifting visual environment.
  </p>

